    { title: "Knowledge is held by a few people", copy: "The best guidance often lives in experienced colleagues, creating bottlenecks and making consistency harder as services grow." },
    { title: "Impact is difficult to evidence", copy: "Funders and commissioners increasingly expect clear proof of reach, outcomes, social value and learning, not just activity totals." }
  ],
  story: {
    eyebrow: "A typical support journey",
    title: "Meet Maya. One setback has become several connected problems.",
    intro: "Maya represents the people mission driven organisations often support: motivated to move forward, but facing overlapping needs and a service system that is difficult to navigate alone.",
    personName: "Maya, 29",
    personContext: "Wants to return to work after ill health, but is also dealing with money worries and low confidence.",
    personImage: "/images/use-cases-v2/care-leavers.webp",
    personAlt: "Illustrated portrait representing Maya, a person seeking support",
    beforeTitle: "Maya cannot find a clear way forward",
    beforeItems: [
      "Information is spread across websites and services, each focused on only one part of her situation.",
