---

<AudienceLanding {...page}>
  <section slot="after-solution" class="section seuk-visual-story" aria-labelledby="seuk-visual-story-title">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-heading audience-heading">
        <div><p class="eyebrow dark">Your service, extended</p><h2 id="seuk-visual-story-title">Your people stay at the centre. Support keeps moving between contacts.</h2></div>
        <p>Bridgit turns repeatable parts of your trusted approach into a connected support journey, then brings a real person back in when judgement, relationships or specialist help matter.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="seuk-journey-visual">
        <img src="/images/landing/seuk-expertise-journey.webp" alt="A social enterprise team extending its expertise through voice coaching, practical plans, follow ups and human support" width="1823" height="863" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption>
          <span><b>01</b><strong>Your expertise</strong><small>Knowledge, tone and pathways</small></span>
          <span><b>02</b><strong>Always available</strong><small>Voice, web and app support</small></span>
          <span><b>03</b><strong>Human when it matters</strong><small>Safe handover with context</small></span>
          <span><b>04</b><strong>Evidence to improve</strong><small>Needs, actions and outcomes</small></span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section slot="after-solution" class="section seuk-packages" id="packages" aria-labelledby="seuk-packages-title">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-heading audience-heading">
        <div><p class="eyebrow dark">Flexible options for SEUK members</p><h2 id="seuk-packages-title">Start small. Grow with confidence.</h2></div>
        <p>Choose the level that matches the support journey you need now. Each package keeps trusted content, human escalation and measurable value at the centre.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="seuk-package-grid">
        <article class="seuk-package-card package-base">
          <p class="package-number">01</p><span class="package-label">Base package</span>
          <h3>Voice Coach &amp; Phone Support</h3>
          <p class="package-price"><strong>£250</strong> per month</p>
          <ul><li>Your own AI voice coach</li><li>A dedicated phone number</li><li>Focused on one clear advice or guidance journey</li><li>A fast, low-friction way to prove engagement</li></ul>
          <a href="#book-a-call">Explore the Base package <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>

        <article class="seuk-package-card package-essentials">
          <p class="package-number">02</p><span class="package-label">Most popular</span>
          <h3>Essentials App</h3>
          <p class="package-price"><strong>£1,000</strong> per month</p>
          <ul><li>Core advice and coaching app with administration</li><li>Up to three AI voice coaches</li><li>Up to five support areas</li><li>Client lists, secure support, toolkits and resources</li></ul>
          <a href="#book-a-call">Explore Essentials <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>

        <article class="seuk-package-card package-integrated">
          <p class="package-number">03</p><span class="package-label">Scale and integrate</span>
          <h3>Fully Integrated</h3>
          <p class="package-price"><small>From</small> <strong>£2,500</strong> per month</p>
          <ul><li>Everything in Essentials</li><li>CRM and workflow integration</li><li>Proactive outreach and wellbeing checks</li><li>Advanced reporting and dedicated onboarding</li></ul>
          <a href="#book-a-call">Discuss an integrated service <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p class="package-scope-note">Indicative current packages. Final scope depends on the journey, configuration, onboarding, integrations and support required.</p>

      <div class="seuk-fit-check">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">A strong first use case</p><h3>Where does your team repeatedly advise, guide, plan with or check in on people?</h3></div>
        <ul><li>Demand is growing faster than staff capacity</li><li>You own trusted content and referral routes</li><li>There is a clear human escalation path</li><li>Progress can be observed during a focused pilot</li></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</AudienceLanding>
